A1: SRC := /opt/data/workspace/hermes-context/
A2: ∀ sync, direction = SRC -> DST, one-way
A3: trigger := systemd --user timer (OnCalendar=every-6h); standalone exec fallback required
A4: rsync if available, else cp -a/tar pipe; semantics = contents-sync, not nesting
A5_mirror: ∀ path -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive; --delete equivalent
A6: --dry-run -> zero writes (incl. logs); DST byte-identical post-run
A7: deletions propagate recursively, both sync paths
A8: log path ∉ DST (default ~/.cache); install paths ∉ mirrored tree
A9: mirror class := {contents, structure, symlinks} only; metadata/timestamps/hardlinks excluded; verify mismatch -> nonzero exit
A10: FAIL iff failure reachable in normal operation; exotic env combos -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS
A11: guard SRC==DST -> abort
A12: guard realpath identity -> abort before destructive ops
A13: order := stage -> verify(content-compare) -> touch DST; destructive op requires verified copy
A14: protected-path guard over owned concrete paths
A15: boundary-aware compare (no prefix-collision false matches)
Deliverables: [sync-hermes-context.sh, hermes-context.service, hermes-context.timer, README.md]
+open: none — all ambiguities resolved Q1–Q11
+validation: packet YAML-parses; must_keep 3/3 verbatim; constants literal
